(7663550, 1249837, 86447, '<td valign="top">what a lovely portrait!<br/> <br/>The background made me uncomfortable until I figured out that it looks like it''s upside down...  grass, mountain, and sky.  Ha!<br/> <br/>Love the sharp focus on his eyes and his direct gaze.</td>', 'what a lovely portrait! The background made me uncomfortable until I figured out that it looks like it''s upside down...  grass, mountain, and sky.  Ha! Love the sharp focus on his eyes and his direct gaze.', '2020-05-22 11:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7663551, 1249855, 86447, '<td valign="top">I love the idea of this.  But, to me, it looks like she''s punched herself with her fist and hit her head around, making her hair fly.   Then, we see up her nose (very clean!) from this angle.  <br/> <br/>She appears to be very beautiful, but this image does not flatter her, I think.<br/> <br/>The colors and bokeh are wonderful.</td>', 'I love the idea of this.  But, to me, it looks like she''s punched herself with her fist and hit her head around, making her hair fly.   Then, we see up her nose (very clean!) from this angle.   She appears to be very beautiful, but this image does not flatter her, I think. The colors and bokeh are wonderful.', '2020-05-22 11:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7663552, 1249849, 86447, '<td valign="top">Thanks.  Now I can''t get the idea of a nekkid bear out of my mind.<br/> <br/>LOL!</td>', 'Thanks.  Now I can''t get the idea of a nekkid bear out of my mind. LOL!', '2020-05-22 11:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
