(7663560, 1249414, 4008, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is in a different league. Very original portrait, very emotive, and very well executed. Great light, great DOF, great detail/texture in the skin. My top pick.</td>', 'Wow, this is in a different league. Very original portrait, very emotive, and very well executed. Great light, great DOF, great detail/texture in the skin. My top pick.', '2020-05-22 12:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
