(7664434, 1249722, 253397, '<td valign="top"><br/>This is such a good photo. And not just because the dog is so cute and sitting still. <br/>The composition is literally making us look exactly where you want us to look, maybe where are you are looking.<br/>The ears and the curvature of the neck, and then going around in the order of importance. <br/>And of course the light beam adds just the right touch, like the icing on top.</td>', 'This is such a good photo. And not just because the dog is so cute and sitting still. The composition is literally making us look exactly where you want us to look, maybe where are you are looking.The ears and the curvature of the neck, and then going around in the order of importance. And of course the light beam adds just the right touch, like the icing on top.', '2020-05-29 07:03:54.000000', NULL, 0),
