(7664438, 1249848, 114969, '<td valign="top">What a fantastic portrait. You perfectly captured the serenity of the moment, and even enhanced it with the superb processing. Sepia tones are THE perfect choice here. Congratulations.</td>', 'What a fantastic portrait. You perfectly captured the serenity of the moment, and even enhanced it with the superb processing. Sepia tones are THE perfect choice here. Congratulations.', '2020-05-29 08:45:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(7664439, 1249722, 114969, '<td valign="top">I concur with the previous comments, this is wonderful. The lighting is perfect (look at those rays!), depth of field is exactly what it needs to be, and the attitude you captured brings much life to the photo. It is so good, one could just expect the dog to turn his head and jump out of the screen. Congratulations!</td>', 'I concur with the previous comments, this is wonderful. The lighting is perfect (look at those rays!), depth of field is exactly what it needs to be, and the attitude you captured brings much life to the photo. It is so good, one could just expect the dog to turn his head and jump out of the screen. Congratulations!', '2020-05-29 08:49:58.000000', NULL, 0),
