(7664588, 1249642, 28742, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Yo_Spiff:</b></div><hr/><i> I''m curious about your nomenclature scheme for all your revisions:<br/>Whitney9971cBLr<br/>Whitney9971cBLar<br/>Whitney9971cBLar2<br/>Whitney9970cLBar<br/>Whitney9970cLBar2<br/>Whitney9971cBLa2r<br/>Whitney9970cLar.jpg<br/>Whitney9971cBLa3r.jpg<br/>Whitney9970cLaBr.jpg<br/>Whitney9971cBLa3r2.jpg </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I''ve been working on that myself. So far, I''ve got two photos, one with 4 edits, one with 6 and she thinks 5 of the images are "Bla". Give me another week and I''ll have this thing cracked.</td>', 'Originally posted by Yo_Spiff: I''m curious about your nomenclature scheme for all your revisions:Whitney9971cBLrWhitney9971cBLarWhitney9971cBLar2Whitney9970cLBarWhitney9970cLBar2Whitney9971cBLa2rWhitney9970cLar.jpgWhitney9971cBLa3r.jpgWhitney9970cLaBr.jpgWhitney9971cBLa3r2.jpg  I''ve been working on that myself. So far, I''ve got two photos, one with 4 edits, one with 6 and she thinks 5 of the images are "Bla". Give me another week and I''ll have this thing cracked.', '2020-05-30 19:19:10.000000', NULL, 0),
